      "whatItForbidsHere": "`uss.sql` for question 02 may not mention `das__`, `dab.`, `dab__` or `read_parquet`; `staged.sql` may not mention `dab` or `dar__uss`. The marimo page runs `uss.sql` verbatim, so a reach past DAR would render, pass, and be exactly the invisible dependency F1 exists to prevent."
