    {
      "rule": "B7 \u2014 change is additive: a new attribute, entity or relationship is a new structure, never a modification",
      "source": "docs/blueprint.md (DAB B7); ADR 0002 \"new entities and measures are appended, never inserted or renamed\"",
      "whatItForbidsHere": "Concretely, this forbids putting CUSTOMER *before* ORDER in `dab/model.yaml`. `entity_keys()` orders the bridge's key columns by model order (`src/adss/uss.py`), so an inserted entity would rearrange the published column contract rather than extend it. CUSTOMER is appended after ORDER; FREIGHT is appended after DESTINATION_COUNTRY inside ORDER; the freight measure is appended after PLACED_ORDERS_COUNT inside the PLACED event. Nothing existing is renamed, retyped or reordered."
