      "whatItForbidsHere": "Forbids a pre-aggregated freight-per-country structure anywhere in DAB, and forbids a CUSTOMER attribute shaped by this one question (a country *grouping*, a 'region bucket'). B3/B4 mean the CUSTOMER mapping historizes rather than snapshots \u2014 which M3 and M4 then make physical."
